description "Redeemed Selkath

Agile creatures prone to mania. Combat-proficient both on land and in the sea. Suppliers of sweet kolto.

^2Weaponry:
- Madclaws (Melee)
-- Poisons on hit
-- Lightweight
-- 10% more damage
-- 25% faster RoF
- Progenitor's Call (1) (Shotgun 2)
-- Stuns on hit
-- Lightweight
-- 20% less velocity

^5Powers:
- Madness (Rage 1) ^3[CS1]
- Insanity (Speed 1) ^3[CS3]
-- Speedlunge

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Getup (4)
- Dexterity (3)
- Strength (1)
- Fury (1)
-- Regen: 1/1s
-- 65% slower decay
- Elemental Resist (1)
- Assemble (1)
- Underwater Breathing
- Ally Stat Viewer
- 5% more knockback given
- 5% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]"